&lt;p&gt;I want to do the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete the gift-exchange&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter a contest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do a flight to better my critique skills&lt;/li&gt;
