&lt;p&gt;I can&#039;t say that I have a favourite SCP but I think this one deserves more recognition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5364&quot;&gt;SCP-5364&lt;/a&gt; &amp;quot;Seventy Millimeter Projector&amp;quot; by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606879512&quot; alt=&quot;PlaguePJP&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp&quot;  &gt;PlaguePJP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best tale I ever had.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
