&lt;p&gt;Kind of requested in the sense that Calibri likes them and asked me if I tried it before. I didn&#039;t so here are my first limericks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;No One Expects The Spanish Decommission!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most beautiful Spanish ship&lt;br /&gt;
