&lt;p&gt;Inspired by: &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-41d3n73-j&quot;&gt;SCP-41-D3N73-J&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trennerdios&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1277937&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606879516&quot; alt=&quot;trennerdios&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1277937)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trennerdios&quot;  &gt;trennerdios&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-6&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;A researcher’s day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raindrops wake me, in every fiber of my being.&lt;br /&gt;
Except my mind, there I&#039;m still dreaming.&lt;br /&gt;
I take a cup of tea, it&#039;s too early and too grey.&lt;br /&gt;
So somber, so weak, what a horrible day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I put on my coat, hood over my head.&lt;br /&gt;
Damn this rain, I want to go back to bed.&lt;br /&gt;
I get in my car and start the tires.&lt;br /&gt;
Arrived at last, the caffeine expires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I turn in my coat for a whiter one.&lt;br /&gt;
Must focus, procedure has begun.&lt;br /&gt;
Needed here to observe a test.&lt;br /&gt;
But I cannot help to feel stressed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subject keeps getting stranger.&lt;br /&gt;
Don&#039;t provoke, D-class in danger.&lt;br /&gt;
Containment breached, stupid keter.&lt;br /&gt;
Results lost, all in the ether.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Got to control room, with little time bought.&lt;br /&gt;
Called for help, anomaly caught.&lt;br /&gt;
Explained to highers and senior.&lt;br /&gt;
No idea, why it&#039;s keener.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s murderous but in very bad shape.&lt;br /&gt;
How the hell did it manage to escape?&lt;br /&gt;
It can&#039;t leave site, security max degree.&lt;br /&gt;
But why do I think it&#039;s already free?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Going back home like the rest of the staff.&lt;br /&gt;
Can&#039;t help but to inner laugh.&lt;br /&gt;
Oh my, how they can&#039;t see…&lt;br /&gt;
That I&#039;m part of this SCP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired by: A poem I wrote earlier for the wiki in basic AABB. Didn&#039;t post it because other things came up. I figured I could put it here instead of forgetting it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
