&lt;p&gt;On 01/18/2021, Site-69 initiated a temporary total site lockdown after multiple reports revealed that on-site and remote Foundation personnel were succumbing to unknown anomalous influences, which was later discovered to be caused by SCP-5949. This lockdown officially ended after 25 hours due to SCP-5949&#039;s anomalous abilities naturally de-manifesting from the affected personnel. During this event, Lead Manager Jerry Sims exchanged a series of emails between SCP-5949&#039;s Containment Specialist team regarding the aforementioned event and the cause of its occurrence:&lt;/p&gt;
