&lt;p&gt;If this is a joke or something, it&#039;s not funny. Did someone mess with SCP-5949? If anyone knows, please respond. Apparently, people are dropping like flies because they&#039;re somehow getting high from their devices?? Seriously, someone explain what&#039;s happening.&lt;/p&gt;
